1. Notify your manager of your absence. Please note that you do not need to disclose any medical information (more information on [communicating illness-related absence](/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#communicating-illness-related-leave) below).
1. Enter the time away in Workday by selecting the label "Out Sick"
1. Your sick time will automatically update in Time Off by Deel
1. If your absence is less than 6 consecutive days, then you do not need to provide a sick note (unless your statutory reporting requirements state otherwise)

